  "introStart": "Get started",
  "intro1Title": "Draw a hexagram, read the moment",
  "intro1Body": "The home screen has four buttons: Draw a Card, Cast with Three Coins, Cast with Yarrow Stalks and Journal. Hold one matter in mind and pick a way to cast. Each hexagram comes with its image, a reading, a small action and a question to help you think things through.",
  "intro2Title": "Journal: note it, look back",
  "intro2Body": "Save your question and hexagram to the journal, set a reminder, and come back later to see what you thought and how things turned out. You can also back up the journal to a file and restore it on a new phone.",
  "intro3Title": "Breathe with the hexagram",
  "intro3Body": "From a reading you can breathe with the soundscapes of its upper and lower trigrams: in for 4 seconds, out for 6. The background tones and bells are tuned to 432 Hz; with headphones you can turn on a 7.83 Hz binaural beat (the two ears differ by 7.83 Hz). Choose 1, 2, 3 or 5 minutes, or set a custom length of up to 60 minutes for a longer sit.",
  "intro4Title": "Sharing and membership",
  "intro4Body": "Turn a hexagram you like into a card and share it with friends. The texts and readings are always free; members get no ads, unlimited casts, longer breathing sessions and binaural beats.",
  "intro5Title": "Tell us what you think",
  "intro5Body": "The menu at the top right of the home screen lets you replay this tour, send us feedback, and choose whether to share anonymous usage stats. Your suggestions help make the app better.",
